OL,3,ABadenoch urges PM to overturn ban on
OL,4,Anew licences as gas drilling gets
OL,5,Ago-ahead at Jackdaw
OL,6,
OL,7,FAsked about Rosebank, an oil field the
OL,8,Fgovernment is yet to make a call on,
OL,9,FFahnbulleh says she will make decisions
OL,10,Fon a "case by case" basis
OL,12,FEnvironmentalists argue more drilling
OL,13,Fwill hamper efforts to cut
OL,14,Fplanet-warming carbon emissions -
OL,15,Fcampaigner Rosie Latchford tells the
OL,16,FBBC: "Jackdaw is bad but Rosebank is a
OL,17,Fdisaster"
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
