OL,3,A'Targeted' attack on much-loved MP
OL,4,Aleaves Australian town heartbroken
OL,5,
OL,6,FWangaratta has been thrust into an
OL,7,Funwelcome spotlight this week.
OL,8,FResidents in this rural Victorian town
OL,9,Fare used to catering to tourists
OL,10,Fpassing through on their way to
OL,11,Fregional wineries, or music lovers
OL,12,Fvisiting its annual jazz and blues
OL,13,Ffestival.
OL,15,FInstead, locals are fielding endless
OL,16,Fquestions about their MP - and having
OL,17,Fto explain to strangers what it all
OL,18,Fmeans for the town's nearly 30,000
OL,19,Fpeople.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
